# Four the Win: a podium in the very middle, and four long lanes wheeling
# round it.

NAME Four the Win
SYMMETRY ROT4
WALLS C Y
START 8 8 SE
TUNNELS                        # mouths mid-edge; drive through to the far side

# The podium: the four middle cells (each quarter turn fills another).
MOVE 15 15
DRAW 16 15

# A lane wall.
MOVE 5 8
DRAW 12 8

# A stub from the top edge.
MOVE 20 1
DRAW 20 4
